# Build inputs for OpenStack 2025.1 Epoxy on Rocky Linux 10.2 — every one pinned.
#
# A branch name is not a pin. `epoxy-rdo` moves whenever RDO pushes to it, so a
# build that fetches "the epoxy-rdo spec" is not reproducible and cannot be
# audited. Each row below names the exact distgit COMMIT; because git objects
# are content-addressed, a commit id fixes the whole spec tree, not just one
# file. The upstream tarball is pinned by sha256 in addition to the GPG
# signature the spec itself verifies in %prep.
#
# Recorded 2026-09-28 from `git ls-remote`. build-epoxy.sh refuses to build a
# package whose checkout or digest does not match these values.
#
# fields: package  distgit-repo  distgit-commit  spec-file  tarball  tarball-sha256  url-project
#
# url-project is the path segment under tarballs.openstack.org. It is usually
# the package name, but the oslo libraries publish under a dotted name
# (oslo.limit) while their distgit and tarball use an underscore.
#
keystone  keystone-distgit  967070efb58987e2d9f5bdf81def3cb32f061a4e  openstack-keystone.spec       keystone-27.0.0.tar.gz             8f9462fcbe98e3d51e37f7e1823183fc44b04c3c4085892342957251c9064252  keystone
placement placement-distgit 45766cd06ac2205d41c7abbe06e5dbad70fc5ac7  openstack-placement.spec      openstack_placement-13.0.0.tar.gz  7a04779a3b2c03409d5fbe7ec1202dd030f816dc394b0e99708d66036cdbcaaf  placement
glance    glance-distgit    6110108606fd6d927875699ba9dec6d1b57e4984  openstack-glance.spec         glance-30.0.0.tar.gz               e29df93474e2a1a34163ee159e72331941cc0b30b000922593f9540c01c68e5a  glance
neutron   neutron-distgit   8ec48e57b963f0798cad147e7f14901b1b8a9ee4  openstack-neutron.spec        neutron-26.0.0.tar.gz              6cd5d7836c1905250dabebc7a8c0cc25501b88941ec9a38fc12d1b3b95febb82  neutron
nova      nova-distgit      c4da8f3f133dcc8d9e1314aefa716e449afc98dc  openstack-nova.spec           nova-31.0.0.tar.gz                 4c13bfd6be60ed110c973a8bf94532740ba746bd4d0e1a415e9bf2b6fef5bc24  nova
horizon   horizon-distgit   5aff204f8f3eb8dc5534175fc5282eeb10005723  python-django-horizon.spec    horizon-25.3.0.tar.gz              8ce6814c7ed97832279f9a80a13f206d3de61863637d00e1d0236591542d2b1b  horizon
oslo-limit oslo-limit-distgit 7164a7b05f4d5c5e55c7111943cd99b27cbe0550  python-oslo-limit.spec  oslo_limit-2.6.1.tar.gz  92337d4534b8940d615e4434c0ae2e48fa733d9f6ec3ab84de4b3b33602968f4  oslo.limit
